        "raw": "<p>I was talking with my friend, and in the process of doing so, came up with an interesting challenge for you guys.</p><p>Team:</p><p>Visionary, Wraith, GI Bunker</p><p>Villian:</p><p>Ambuscade (Anyone will work)</p><p>Environment:</p><p>You&#39;re choice</p><p>Challenge:</p><p>The only damage your heros can deal to Ambuscade is through Psychic Maelstrom, Stun Bolts without micro targeting computers and Throat Jabs (his devices can be damaged any way you like). The rest has to be left up to the environment. If you want, you may start the game with Mass Levitation in the Visionary&#39;s hand</p>",
