      {
        "id": 140789,
        "name": "VisforYoshi",
        "username": "VisforYoshi",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/visforyoshi/{size}/2185_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-21T23:18:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sorry for the double post, but I feel like I should show the screenshots when I did it. No point in making a challenge if i can't do it after all. The first one was the final field before the environments overran Ambuscad, the second was the killing blow.</p><p>For Wraith, I had all three stun bolts, a utility belt, two infared eyepieces, a mega computer, and some smoke bombs out.</p><p>Bunker had a Flak cannon (for the pesky devices), a maitenence unit, and turret mode out</p><p>Visionary had two mass levitations, a decoy projection, and a foresight out. With Twist the ether behind ambuscade.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Luckily the damage control started off well because I had two impromptu inventions and a utility belt in my starting hand, but I had to use foresight in order to rush out mass levitation. It started off really annoying as ambuscade kept getting out his cloaking device whenever I destroyed it, and he also had out a rocket launcher and an automated turret (the latter of which was trouble to damage control, since my focas was controlling ambuscade). Eventually, the cloaking stopped appearing, and i managed to kill him by using GI bunker's power to make the damage by environment irreducable (while keeping my heros safe with a -4 damage buff)</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:17:45.756Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
